desc:
I developed RicordApp.it, a web app created in response to a real need expressed by a nutritionist who works by appointment, and it has already been tested in everyday use.

The service helps small professionals organise their appointments and quickly prepare reminders to send to clients via WhatsApp. It is intended, for example, for nutritionists, speech therapists, psychologists, physiotherapists, dentists, veterinarians, beauticians, hairdressers and, more generally, anyone who works by appointment.

RicordApp offers free access and is intended to remain free for occasional use. In the future, only a small symbolic contribution may be requested from users who use the service regularly.

I would now like to introduce the service to a wider audience and I am looking for a freelancer experienced in organic promotion within Facebook groups and other professional online communities.

The work should include:

researching genuinely relevant and active groups and communities;
checking the posting rules;
contacting group administrators when necessary;
preparing natural and non-intrusive promotional messages;
publishing only where permitted or authorised;
delivering a final report including the groups contacted, links to the posts and the results achieved, divided by professional category.

I am not looking for automated posting, spam, fake profiles or bulk private messages.

I would like to begin with a simple collaboration and a limited budget, in order to assess its effectivenes
